ERROR at line 2: `#[allow(unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn)]` is not accepted — `unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn` is a hard rule, not a lint, so none of `#[allow]` / `#[warn]` / `#[deny]` / `#[expect]` apply (Kāra is greenfield; there is no migration story). Wrap the offending operation in an `unsafe { ... }` block instead, and add a `// Safety: ...` comment above the block per the `undocumented_unsafe` lint.
